text:
@tatachan31 thank you so much for your encouraging words. I’ve written down my thoughts, in the hope that they might be of use to someone one day. 

take care of yourself dude, we're caring so much about you. I hope our paths cross one day. but for now...
goodnight, sleep well <3

@quenaoseioqnseioqla ...Your words reached me more deeply than I know how to say how that even the smallest spark of inspiration can become a light for someone else, and because of that, I feel a little braver about continuing to write.

Thank You, 
and now a good night X3

